  "bio": "DRAWTATTOO, located in the heart of Paris, France, is a hip-hop-inspired tattoo studio specializing in minimalist, dotwork, and lettering styles. Famously known as the premier salon for expertise in tattoos on black and mixed-race skin, DRAWTATTOO encourages individuality, urging everyone to \"Be Unique.\" This creative haven also houses the DRAWTATTOO Academy, dedicated to nurturing the next wave of tattoo artists.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Paris, Ile-de-france, France"
